{"timestamp": 1779476899.75564, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 19, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Diana"}, {"room": "upper_engine", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779476899.756334, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 19, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779476922.0481138, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in Upper Engine. There\u2019s also a body in Electrical \u2014 Diana.\n\nMy route was Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine. Early on I saw Frank in Electrical around ticks 3-5, and Diana entered Electrical from Security at tick 5. Later I saw Charlie in Weapons around 13-14, then Charlie and Bob in Medbay around tick 17. Charlie came into Medbay from Cafeteria.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Eve at all until I found her body in Upper Engine. Biggest thing from my info is Frank was in Electrical with Diana when I last saw her alive, so I\u2019d like to hear Frank\u2019s route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779476933.31248, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alright, let me lay out my route honestly: Cafeteria \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Weapons.\n\nYes, I was in Electrical early \u2014 ticks 3 through 5 \u2014 and Alice was right there with me the whole time. She can confirm that. Diana came in from Security around tick 5, and at that point Alice, Diana, and I were all together in Electrical. I left shortly after to head to Medbay, then up to Upper Engine around tick 11 \u2014 and that's where I saw Eve. She entered Upper Engine from Lower Engine. She was alive when I passed through. I went on to Oxygen, back through Cafeteria, and ended in Weapons.\n\nSo a couple of important things: Alice can vouch I didn't do anything to Diana in Electrical \u2014 she was with me. And if Eve died in Upper Engine after tick 11, someone came in from Lower Engine or Medbay after I left. I'd really like to hear from Bob and Charlie \u2014 where were they during ticks 5-15? Alice mentioned Charlie was in Weapons around 13-14, but who was near Upper Engine or Electrical when the kills happened?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779476957.579846, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My route was Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Storage \u2192 Medbay. I saw Diana enter Security from Navigation at tick 3, then I later saw Charlie in Navigation around ticks 7 and 8, and Charlie left Navigation toward Security at tick 9. I ended up in Medbay and saw Alice there around tick 17 and Charlie there around tick 18.\n\nDiana going from Security to Electrical by tick 5 lines up with Alice and Frank\u2019s stories, so that part checks out. I don\u2019t have direct info on Electrical after that. The thing I can add is Charlie was definitely on the right side at Navigation/Security around tick 7-9, and Alice says she saw Charlie in Weapons around 13-14, which is possible from Security.\n\nFor Eve, Frank says he saw her alive in Upper Engine around tick 11, and Alice found her there later. I never went near Upper Engine, so I can\u2019t confirm that. Right now I don\u2019t think I have enough to hard accuse, but Charlie\u2019s path through Security after Diana had gone toward Electrical is worth hearing about. Charlie should explain exactly where he went after leaving Navigation at tick 9 and before Medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477052.504982, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay. I never went into Electrical or Upper Engine.\n\nI saw Diana alive in Security around tick 3, and Bob was around that right side route too. Then I was in Navigation with Bob around ticks 8-9, went back through Security, then to Weapons. Alice saw me in Weapons around ticks 12-14, and Bob saw me in Medbay at 18, so the timing doesn\u2019t really let me detour into Electrical and still be where people saw me.\n\nFor Diana: she ends up in Electrical after I saw her in Security, and Alice/Frank both say she entered Electrical around tick 5. That makes Alice and Frank the key people for that kill.\n\nFor Eve: Frank says he saw Eve alive in Upper Engine around tick 11, and then Alice later finds her body there. So again, the main people connected to the death locations are Frank and Alice.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Frank here because he was in Electrical with Diana early and is also the only one claiming to have seen Eve alive in Upper Engine. Bob and I mostly confirm each other on the right side, and Alice confirms me in Weapons. I don\u2019t think this should be on Bob or me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477077.0826519, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I want to push back on Frank saying I can vouch him for Diana \u2014 I only saw him in Electrical through tick 5 when Diana entered. I left after that, so I cannot clear him for what happened in Electrical afterward.\n\nLooking at both bodies, Frank is the only person who directly connects to both kill locations: he was in Electrical with Diana early, and he also says he was in Upper Engine with Eve around tick 11. Bob and Charlie have a pretty consistent right-side route, and I personally saw Charlie in Weapons at 13-14 and then Medbay at 17, with Bob also in Medbay.\n\nSo my strongest suspicion is Frank. He had opportunity for Diana after I left Electrical, and he\u2019s the last claimed person to see Eve alive in Upper Engine."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477089.8822122, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Hold on, let me address Alice's pivot here, because this is exactly the kind of thing that gets innocents voted out.\n\nAlice, you were in Electrical with me from tick 3 to 5. Diana came in at tick 5. I stayed until about tick 6, then left for Medbay. So the window for me to kill Diana in Electrical is basically tick 6 \u2014 one tick after you saw her enter. If I killed her that fast, you would have walked back into Electrical and found the body, because you said your next stop after Electrical was Security. You'd have been the closest person to that body and you'd have reported it then. You didn't. That suggests Diana was alive when I left.\n\nAnd on Eve \u2014 yes, I saw her enter Upper Engine from Lower Engine at tick 11. I was passing through on my way to Oxygen. If I killed her there, why would I volunteer that I was the last one to see her alive? That's the worst possible alibi to fabricate. I'm telling you because it's the truth and it narrows down who came into Upper Engine after me \u2014 someone from Medbay or Lower Engine after tick 11.\n\nAlice, your route ends at Upper Engine where you \"found\" Eve. You also had access to Electrical earlier. You're connected to both bodies too \u2014 and you're the reporter. I'm not hard-accusing yet, but the pivot from \"Frank was with me\" to \"actually I can't vouch for Frank\" right when it's convenient is suspicious.\n\nI want to hear if anyone can confirm Alice's Cafeteria/Medbay segment between ticks 6 and 16."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477118.210863, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I still think this is between Frank and Alice, but Frank\u2019s defense doesn\u2019t fully work for me.\n\nFrom my side, I can confirm Charlie was on the right: I saw him in Navigation ticks 7-8, and he left toward Security at tick 9. Then Alice says she saw him in Weapons 13-14, and I saw him in Medbay at 18. That route is pretty consistent and doesn\u2019t really put him at either body location.\n\nFor Diana: I saw Diana enter Security from Navigation at tick 3, and then Alice/Frank both say she went into Electrical around tick 5. After that, Frank is the one who stayed in Electrical after Alice says she left. Frank saying Alice would have found the body doesn\u2019t make sense to me \u2014 if Alice went Electrical to Security, she wouldn\u2019t necessarily see inside Electrical again.\n\nFor Eve: Frank is also the one claiming he saw her alive in Upper Engine around tick 11, and Alice later reports her body there. So Frank is connected to both places by his own route.\n\nAlice is not impossible because she reported and had access, but based on the stories, Frank has the clearest opportunity on both kills. I\u2019m leaning Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477170.7781389, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m still landing on Frank.\n\nTo restate my info: I was on the right side the whole round \u2014 Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay. I saw Diana alive in Security at tick 3. I saw Bob in Navigation around ticks 8-9, then I went back through Security to Weapons. Alice was with me in Weapons ticks 12-14, and Bob saw me later in Medbay around tick 18.\n\nSo Bob and I are pretty locked to the right-side path, and Alice being in Weapons with me at 12-14 is real.\n\nThe key point is there is only one Duck, so whoever did this had to have access to both Diana in Electrical and Eve in Upper Engine. Frank\u2019s own route puts him in Electrical with Diana after she entered, then in Upper Engine where he claims Eve was alive. That\u2019s the cleanest connection to both bodies.\n\nAlice could technically be a self-report, but Frank has the stronger opportunity on both kills. I think we vote Frank here."}}
